#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:131
msgid "Avoid crossing curled overhangs (Experimental)"
msgstr ""

#. TRN PrintSettings: "Avoid crossing curled overhangs (Experimental)"
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:137
msgid ""
"Plan travel moves such that the extruder avoids areas where the filament may "
"be curled up. This is mostly happening on steeper rounded overhangs and may "
"cause a crash with the nozzle. This feature slows down both the print and "
"the G-code generation."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:144
msgid "Avoid crossing perimeters"
msgstr "교체된 둘레를 피하세요."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:149
msgid ""
"Optimize travel moves in order to minimize the crossing of perimeters. This "
"is mostly useful with Bowden extruders which suffer from oozing. This "
"feature slows down both the print and the G-code generation."
msgstr ""
"둘레의 교차를 최소화하기 위해 여행 이동을 최적화하십시오. 이것은 보잉 "
"(Bowling) 압출기가 흘러 나오기 쉬운 경우에 주로 유용합니다. 이 기능을 사용하"
"면 인쇄 및 G 코드 생성 속도가 느려집니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:156
msgid "Avoid crossing perimeters - Max detour length"
msgstr "경계를 넘어가지 마십시오 - 최대 우회 길이"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:161
msgid ""
"The maximum detour length for avoid crossing perimeters. If the detour is "
"longer than this value, avoid crossing perimeters is not applied for this "
"travel path. Detour length could be specified either as an absolute value or "
"as percentage (for example 50%) of a direct travel path."
msgstr ""
"경계를 넘어가지 않도록 최대 우회 길이입니다. 우회가 이 값보다 긴 경우 이 이"
"동 경로에 경계 횡단이 적용되지 않는 것을 피하십시오. 우회 길이는 절대 값 또"
"는 백분율(예: 50%)으로 지정할 수 있습니다. 직항 경로."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:164
msgid "mm or % (zero to disable)"
msgstr "mm 또는 %(비활성화할 0)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:171
msgid "Bed other layers"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:176
msgid ""
"Bed temperature for layers after the first one. Set this to zero to disable "
"bed temperature control commands in the output."
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 레이어 이후의 레이어 온도. 이 값을 0으로 설정하면 출력에서 ​​베드 온도 "
"제어 명령을 비활성화합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:178
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:195
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:212
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1644
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:1737
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4302
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:4821
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:29
msgid "°C"
msgstr "℃"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:179
msgid "Bed temperature"
msgstr "배드 온도"

#. TRN: Label of a configuration parameter: Nominal chamber temperature.
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:187
msgid "Chamber Nominal temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:192
msgid "Chamber temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:193
msgid ""
"Required chamber temperature for the print.\n"
"When set to zero, the nominal chamber temperature is not set in the G-code."
msgstr ""

#. TRN: Label of a configuration parameter: Minimal chamber temperature
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:203
msgid "Chamber Minimal temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:208
msgid "Chamber minimal temperature"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:209
msgid ""
"Minimal chamber temperature that the printer waits for before the print "
"starts. This allows to start the print before the nominal chamber "
"temperature is reached.\n"
"When set to zero, the minimal chamber temperature is not set in the G-code."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:219
msgid "Bed temperature by extruder"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:224
msgid ""
"The extruder which determines bed temperatures. Set to 0 to determine "
"temperatures based on the first printing extruder of the first and the "
"second layers."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:237
msgid ""
"This custom code is inserted at every layer change, right before the Z move. "
"Note that you can use placeholder variables for all Slic3r settings as well "
"as [layer_num] and [layer_z]."
msgstr ""
"이 사용자 정의 코드는 Z 이동 직전의 모든 레이어 변경에 삽입됩니다. Slic3r 설"
"정과 [layer_num] 및 [layer_z]에 대한 자리 표시 자 변수를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:247
msgid "Between objects G-code"
msgstr "객체 간 G 코드"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:252
msgid ""
"This code is inserted between objects when using sequential printing. By "
"default extruder and bed temperature are reset using non-wait command; "
"however if M104, M109, M140 or M190 are detected in this custom code, Slic3r "
"will not add temperature commands. Note that you can use placeholder "
"variables for all Slic3r settings, so you can put a \"M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]\" command wherever you want."
msgstr ""
"이 코드는 순차 인쇄를 사용할 때 객체간에 삽입됩니다. 기본적으로 익스트루더 "
"및 베드 온도는 대기 모드가 아닌 명령을 사용하여 재설정됩니다. 그러나 이 사용"
"자 코드에서 M104, M109, M140 또는 M190이 감지되면 Slic3r은 온도 명령을 추가하"
"지 않습니다. 모든 Slic3r 설정에 자리 표시 변수를 사용할 수 있으므로 원하는 위"
"치에 \"M109 S[first_layer_temperature]\"명령을 넣을 수 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:261
msgid "Bottom solid layers"
msgstr "바닥 단일 레이어"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:267
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on bottom surfaces."
msgstr "바닥면에 생성할 솔리드 레이어의 수."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:279
msgid ""
"The number of bottom solid layers is increased above bottom_solid_layers if "
"necessary to satisfy minimum thickness of bottom shell."
msgstr ""
"바닥 쉘의 최소 두께를 충족하기 위해 필요한 경우 바닥 솔리드 레이어의 수가 "
"bottom_solid_layers 이상 증가합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigBoxesFDM.cpp:281
msgid "Minimum bottom shell thickness"
msgstr "최소 바닥 쉘 두께"

